{"id":"miseria","lemma":"miseria","pos":"noun","rank":3082,"glosses":["misery","poverty","avarice, greed"],"ipa":"/miˈseɾja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"miserias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-miseria.wav","examples":[{"text":"La familia estaba en la miseria.","en":"The family lived in poverty.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La miseria y el dolor acompañan la guerra.","en":"Misery and sorrow accompany war.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152104","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"pain"},{"g":"to accompany","l":"acompañar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"war, warfare"}]},{"text":"Alguien debería de sacar a ese perro de su miseria.","en":"Someone should put that dog out of its misery.","words":[{"g":"someone, somebody"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to put out, to get out"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Los dos poemas expresan la miseria humana.","en":"The two poems express human suffering.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"poem","l":"poema"},{"g":"to express","l":"expresar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"human","l":"humano"}]},{"text":"Ella se divorció de él luego de muchos años de miseria.","en":"She divorced him after many years of unhappiness.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to divorce","l":"divorciar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"he"},null,null,{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"year","l":"año"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"right after, following"]]}]}